1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 14=

4
00:01:21,990 --> 00:01:25,980
♪A silent shock breaks
through this fleeting dream♪

5
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:31,620
♪Fate is impossible to predict or trace♪

6
00:01:33,350 --> 00:01:38,050
♪The past has become a series of trials♪

7
00:01:39,260 --> 00:01:40,140
(In Memory of the Seventh Prince,
Zhao Boqing)

8
00:01:40,150 --> 00:01:42,310
I never thought the girl
who bit me back then

9
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,510
was you.

10
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:46,580
♪The flickering lights
cast overlapping shadows♪

11
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:49,350
♪Through each trial and thought,
the years pass by♪

12
00:01:49,570 --> 00:01:52,260
♪A cold blade gleams
against the frost and snow♪

13
00:01:52,450 --> 00:01:55,040
♪How can fate ever be understood?♪

14
00:01:55,250 --> 00:01:57,860
♪Old dreams scatter,
blood turning to snow♪

15
00:01:58,030 --> 00:02:00,840
♪A lone shadow seeks escape
from these trials♪

16
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:06,640
♪Who can live this life without regret?♪

17
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:21,150
You...

18
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,020
Why are you so stiff?

19
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:23,870
Are you tired?

20
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:28,910
Focus.

21
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,470
My heart belongs to you.

22
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,120
It has nothing to do
with the Crown Prince

23
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:42,630
or the realm.

24
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,960
Please,

25
00:02:44,630 --> 00:02:45,710
don't leave me.

26
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:51,060
♪Where can this longing heart
find its home?♪

27
00:02:52,410 --> 00:02:57,170
♪The past has become a series of trials♪

28
00:02:57,340 --> 00:03:02,410
♪Who can live this life
without failing those they love?♪

29
00:03:02,980 --> 00:03:05,660
♪The flickering lights
cast overlapping shadows♪

30
00:03:05,830 --> 00:03:08,480
♪Through each trial and thought,
the years pass by♪

31
00:03:08,630 --> 00:03:11,250
♪A cold blade gleams
against the frost and snow♪

32
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:14,180
♪How can fate ever be understood?♪

33
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,190
Miss He.

34
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,400
The Seventh Prince instructed us

35
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,310
to bury these three items with him.

36
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,710
He said

37
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,680
he would take them into the next life.

38
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:25,580
♪Unbroken♪

39
00:03:25,580 --> 00:03:28,250
♪The flickering lights
cast overlapping shadows♪

40
00:03:28,410 --> 00:03:30,980
♪Through each trial and thought,
the years pass by♪

41
00:03:31,180 --> 00:03:33,860
♪A cold blade gleams
against the frost and snow♪

42
00:03:35,630 --> 00:03:36,750
Zhao Boqing.

43
00:03:36,820 --> 00:03:39,390
♪Old dreams scatter,
blood turning to snow♪

44
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,800
Didn't you say...

45
00:03:41,190 --> 00:03:43,630
Didn't you say
there wouldn't be another cycle?

46
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:49,310
Then why did
you prepare these burial items

47
00:03:50,590 --> 00:03:53,400
as if you were going to meet me again?

48
00:04:07,620 --> 00:04:09,460
(Imperial Prison)

49
00:04:24,070 --> 00:04:25,310
You old traitor.

50
00:04:25,870 --> 00:04:27,800
You went to great lengths to see me.

51
00:04:28,310 --> 00:04:29,600
Now that I'm here,

52
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,560
if you have something to say,

53
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:32,120
say it.

54
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,310
Your Highness,

55
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,510
do you think

56
00:04:35,950 --> 00:04:37,390
this is the end?

57
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,600
The real show

58
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,630
has only just begun.

59
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:46,750
You really think
you're the Crown Princess now?

60
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:49,120
The Imperial Wardrobe Bureau
just received new cloud brocade.

61
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,720
What makes you think
you deserve to choose any?

62
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,720
A sparrow draped in brocade

63
00:05:01,870 --> 00:05:03,560
will never become a phoenix.

64
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,680
(Yu Feilin?)

65
00:05:07,630 --> 00:05:09,000
(Wasn't she imprisoned?)

66
00:05:09,830 --> 00:05:10,830
Yu Feilin!

67
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:15,270
How dare you

68
00:05:15,750 --> 00:05:17,040
bully my sister-in-law in my palace?

69
00:05:18,310 --> 00:05:18,920
Your Highness,

70
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,430
I was just...

71
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:21,190
Just what?

72
00:05:21,190 --> 00:05:22,310
You're not welcome here.

73
00:05:22,750 --> 00:05:23,240
Get out.

74
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:34,630
Sister-in-law,

75
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:35,870
did Yu Feilin

76
00:05:35,870 --> 00:05:37,870
upset you with those rumors again?

77
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,430
Your Highness, what did you call me?

78
00:05:42,270 --> 00:05:43,480
Sister-in-law.

79
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:47,560
Yuan Yuan,

80
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,510
have you forgotten?

81
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,360
At the flower-viewing banquet,

82
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:52,480
my brother asked for your hand
in front of everyone.

83
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,750
Everyone in the palace knows

84
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,510
you're the future Crown Princess.

85
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,800
He Xiaoyuan is in trouble now.

86
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,310
I fell in love with you at first sight.

87
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:08,000
Will you become my Crown Princess?

88
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,510
When did the Crown Prince fall for her?

89
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:11,270
Goodness!

90
00:06:12,270 --> 00:06:13,120
(Sister-in-law?)

91
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,750
(How could I be her sister-in-law?)

92
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,040
(Where's Zhao Boqing?)

93
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:16,950
(Where's the Imperial Preceptor?)

94
00:06:17,390 --> 00:06:19,120
(The thirty-fifth lifetime has begun?)

95
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,830
(But why is everything)

96
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,390
(so different this time?)

97
00:06:23,190 --> 00:06:24,070
Sister-in-law,

98
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,000
you look terrible.

99
00:06:26,390 --> 00:06:27,560
Did you have a nightmare?

100
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:28,920
I'll get an Imperial Physician.

101
00:06:28,950 --> 00:06:30,120
I'm fine, Your Highness.

102
00:06:31,630 --> 00:06:32,630
Where is the Seventh Prince?

103
00:06:32,630 --> 00:06:33,560
Where is he now?

104
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:36,950
Boqing

105
00:06:36,950 --> 00:06:38,510
was attacked some time ago.

106
00:06:38,750 --> 00:06:40,120
He's recovering at Qingyan Palace.

107
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,680
The Imperial Physician
said he still needs plenty of rest,

108
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,870
so lately,

109
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,630
even I rarely get to see him.

110
00:06:47,190 --> 00:06:48,240
But don't worry,

111
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,750
Boqing's life is not in danger.

112
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:51,310
(How could this be?)

113
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:53,920
(The cycle really has restarted.)

114
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,920
(But in the Seventh Prince's
previous lives,)

115
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,160
(he was never attacked.)

116
00:06:58,460 --> 00:07:00,940
(Qingyan Palace)

117
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,040
Take it off.

118
00:07:08,510 --> 00:07:09,510
What are you talking about?

119
00:07:09,870 --> 00:07:11,240
Stop pretending.

120
00:07:11,430 --> 00:07:12,560
Let me see where you're hurt.

121
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,430
When were you attacked?

122
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:18,000
Please mind your conduct,
Crown Princess.

123
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,000
What did you call me?

124
00:07:30,070 --> 00:07:31,160
This time,

125
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,870
you don't remember?

126
00:07:33,270 --> 00:07:33,750
Your Highness.

127
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,510
Crown Princess.

128
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,000
This is...

129
00:07:39,830 --> 00:07:40,800
(Fu Yang is still here.)

130
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,390
(I'd better)

131
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:43,750
(find another chance to tell him.)

132
00:07:48,390 --> 00:07:49,800
The Crown Prince sent me

133
00:07:49,950 --> 00:07:51,160
to visit the Seventh Prince.

134
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:52,950
Since you're not seriously hurt,

135
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,480
rest and recover here.

136
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:55,600
I'll take my leave.

137
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:05,240
Pour out this medicine.

138
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:06,310
Yes.

139
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:07,630
By the way,

140
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,390
how is the investigation
into the assassins going?

141
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:11,510
Your Highness,

142
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,830
the scene was thoroughly cleaned up.

143
00:08:13,950 --> 00:08:14,750
No survivors were left.

144
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:15,630
Whoever was behind it

145
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:16,800
has covered their tracks well.

146
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,510
We have no solid leads yet.

147
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:19,560
Very well.

148
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:21,630
Since they're making no moves,

149
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,430
we'll simply wait.

150
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:26,190
Your Highness,

151
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,720
Study Companion He's behavior just now

152
00:08:29,310 --> 00:08:30,160
was truly

153
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,150
baffling.

154
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,120
Very strange indeed.

155
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,270
Yes, very strange.

156
00:08:35,750 --> 00:08:37,750
She looked so worried
she lost all composure.

157
00:08:38,910 --> 00:08:40,440
It was utterly absurd.

158
00:08:41,150 --> 00:08:42,600
A woman acting like that

159
00:08:42,910 --> 00:08:44,440
most likely means
the future Crown Princess

160
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,150
has feelings for you, Your Highness.

161
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,600
Your Highness,

162
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,080
our informants

163
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:52,870
have no new intelligence for now.

164
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,750
Since she's approaching me
of her own accord,

165
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,390
why wouldn't I take advantage of

166
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:00,320
such a perfect opportunity?

167
00:09:02,260 --> 00:09:05,260
(Several Months Ago)

168
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:06,320
Do you know why

169
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:08,840
I paid a high price to buy you
out of the pleasure house?

170
00:09:09,870 --> 00:09:11,320
Please enlighten me, Your Highness.

171
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,670
Because you're perceptive

172
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,870
and both talented and beautiful.

173
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,630
You make a useful pawn.

174
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:25,870
The Crown Prince will soon
be formally named heir apparent.

175
00:09:26,510 --> 00:09:27,320
And I want you

176
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,440
to perform a dance
at the flower-viewing banquet.

177
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:31,080
With your talent and beauty,

178
00:09:31,390 --> 00:09:33,030
it won't be hard to catch
the Crown Prince's eye.

179
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,120
Remember,

180
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,960
infiltrate the Eastern Palace

181
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,670
and report the Crown Prince's
activities to me.

182
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,270
Thank you for taking me
under your wing, Your Highness.

183
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:40,550
I

184
00:09:42,390 --> 00:09:43,600
will not fail you.

185
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,150
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

186
00:10:17,510 --> 00:10:18,670
He Xiaoyuan is in trouble now.

187
00:10:19,150 --> 00:10:19,550
Indeed.

188
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:20,960
I fell in love with you at first sight.

189
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,670
Will you become my Crown Princess?

190
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,630
- When did the Crown Prince fall for her?
- Crown Princess?

191
00:10:24,750 --> 00:10:26,550
Goodness, He Xiaoyuan
is no ordinary woman.

192
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,390
(Everything should
have gone according to plan.)

193
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:32,270
(But unexpectedly,)

194
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,440
(Zhao Junyao actually
fell for He Xiaoyuan,)

195
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:36,960
(a seemingly
unremarkable study companion.)

196
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:37,960
(This woman)

197
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:40,360
(has disrupted all my plans.)

198
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,360
He Xiaoyuan

199
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:45,390
is nothing but an obstacle.

200
00:10:46,390 --> 00:10:48,510
I need to find
a chance to get rid of her

201
00:10:48,510 --> 00:10:50,910
so you can get closer
to the Crown Prince.

202
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:54,510
But she comes from a respectable,
uncomplicated family,

203
00:10:54,510 --> 00:10:55,790
has a very simple social circle,

204
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,550
and rarely goes out.

205
00:10:57,750 --> 00:10:59,200
There's almost nothing we can find

206
00:10:59,550 --> 00:11:00,480
to use against her.

207
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,960
Didn't she come to us herself today?

208
00:11:06,390 --> 00:11:08,240
Her unusual concern

209
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:10,440
is exactly the opening we need.

210
00:11:12,030 --> 00:11:13,840
I'll arrange an accident

211
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,270
so that the newly chosen Crown Princess

212
00:11:16,270 --> 00:11:17,080
will tragically

213
00:11:17,910 --> 00:11:19,120
meet her end.

214
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,630
When the Crown Prince is devastated,

215
00:11:21,790 --> 00:11:24,080
that will be your chance
to step in again.

216
00:11:24,910 --> 00:11:25,720
Yes.

217
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,960
He Xiaoyuan.

218
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:37,000
How did I suddenly

219
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,240
become the Crown Princess
in this lifetime?

220
00:11:38,550 --> 00:11:40,030
And Zhao Boqing has lost his memory.

221
00:11:40,870 --> 00:11:41,750
This is too strange.

222
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,000
Xiaoyuan.

223
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,720
I heard you haven't been feeling well.

224
00:11:49,910 --> 00:11:51,000
Have you seen an Imperial Physician?

225
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,320
(And in this lifetime,)

226
00:11:55,750 --> 00:11:57,320
(the Crown Prince actually
fell in love with me)

227
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,550
(at first sight
at the flower-viewing banquet.)

228
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,600
(And now he's so attentive.)

229
00:12:01,030 --> 00:12:02,390
(Everything is different from before.)

230
00:12:02,390 --> 00:12:02,960
What's wrong?

231
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:04,840
Thank you for your concern,
Your Highness.

232
00:12:05,270 --> 00:12:07,120
I've just caught a slight cold.

233
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,510
I'll be fine after some rest.

234
00:12:10,750 --> 00:12:12,320
I've been so busy
with state affairs lately

235
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,510
that I haven't taken good care of you.

236
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:14,750
Are you upset with me?

237
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,720
(I'm sorry, Your Highness.)

238
00:12:17,790 --> 00:12:18,670
(But my heart)

239
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,440
(already belongs to someone else.)

240
00:12:20,790 --> 00:12:21,910
(There's no room for anyone else.)

241
00:12:22,510 --> 00:12:23,600
(Other than avoiding you,)

242
00:12:24,150 --> 00:12:25,390
(I don't know what else to do.)

243
00:12:26,390 --> 00:12:27,510
You're worrying too much, Your Highness.

244
00:12:27,870 --> 00:12:28,720
I

245
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,670
simply haven't recovered from my cold.

246
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,080
I'm afraid I might pass it on to you.

247
00:12:33,910 --> 00:12:34,360
It's all right.

248
00:12:34,630 --> 00:12:35,270
It's windy here.

249
00:12:35,750 --> 00:12:36,670
I'll walk you back.

250
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,840
There's no need
to trouble yourself, Your Highness.

251
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:42,720
I can return to the palace on my own.

252
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:43,870
I'll take my leave.

253
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:51,480
Zhuguang.

254
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,080
Who did the Crown Princess see today?

255
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,630
She first went to see the Princess.

256
00:12:57,150 --> 00:12:57,720
As it happened,

257
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,240
Young Lady Yu was there too.

258
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,120
Yu Feilin?

259
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,240
Did Yu Feilin give her a hard time?

260
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:04,790
Well...

261
00:13:04,910 --> 00:13:06,670
You know

262
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,200
what Young Lady Yu is like.

263
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:09,390
Dig up everything the Yu family

264
00:13:09,390 --> 00:13:11,270
has done over the years involving
corruption and abuse of power.

265
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:14,440
If they can't keep
their own daughter in line,

266
00:13:15,630 --> 00:13:17,550
I'll teach them some discipline.

267
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:18,440
Yes.

268
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,120
Also,

269
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:22,600
after leaving the Princess,

270
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,790
the Crown Princess
went to Qingyan Palace

271
00:13:24,270 --> 00:13:25,440
to see the Seventh Prince.

272
00:13:26,270 --> 00:13:27,080
Your Highness,

273
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:28,840
for our future

274
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,240
Crown Princess...

275
00:13:30,630 --> 00:13:31,870
Keep watching her.

276
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:34,000
I want to know exactly
who she sees every day,

277
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,240
what she says,

278
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:36,790
even every look she gives.

279
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:40,270
I want to know everything.

280
00:13:56,300 --> 00:13:58,620
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

281
00:13:58,980 --> 00:14:00,660
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

282
00:14:01,300 --> 00:14:04,300
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

283
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:09,140
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

284
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:11,900
♪My heart has long known♪

285
00:14:12,340 --> 00:14:14,340
♪We made a promise long ago♪

286
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:16,260
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

287
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:20,260
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

288
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:23,420
♪How much must I let go♪

289
00:14:23,740 --> 00:14:25,420
♪For one moment♪

290
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:28,420
♪To hold each other close♪

291
00:14:28,660 --> 00:14:32,980
♪Would that be enough?♪
